1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Round two, match one of the Royal Knight's selection exam.

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Soul trapped Mimosa with her magic.

6
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Asta defended their crystal from Magna, who launched an all-out solo attack. Then...

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Seems you're forgetting about this, dashing mage.

8
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Yikes, two against one. Not good.

9
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Asta's mysterious teammate, Zerx, came to his rescue.

10
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Go after the flower guy! Do it now!

11
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:03,000
This will only slow me for a moment, that's all I need! To beat you!

12
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Mimosa deployed a plant spell that stopped Soul's Golem in its tracks.

13
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:13,000
And Asta and the rest of Team B were able to claim victory.

14
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:16,000
And now, Finral and Longris prepare to face off.

15
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Who will win in this Battle of Brothers?

16
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Mimosa.

17
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Kikiiki, kimi no koto.

18
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Wah wah wah wah, wa wa kara na i da kara.

19
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Wah wah wah, boku no koto.

20
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:31,000
Kikiiki, kiko maata shira na i de sho.

21
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Wah wah wah, boku no koto.

22
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Wah wah wah, wok mo koto.

23
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Wah wah wah, wakaru to kata ni iwa nai.

24
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,000
Give me theusion.

25
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:42,000
I'll give you Fürig.

26
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:50,000
My centrally surrounded by GEGA .

27
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Rune a little Avec ок guer,

28
00:01:55,100 --> 00:01:59,500
Is it just a glove-ruck with nasseku?

29
00:01:59,660 --> 00:02:01,000
Oh.

30
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:06,000
Now over that each side fell apart,

31
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:08,600
Thank you!

32
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:49,000
他的富貴

33
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:58,000
That's much better.

34
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:00,500
Uh, thank-you, Vanessa. That's great.

35
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:02,700
Great? Try perfect!

36
00:03:02,700 --> 00:03:03,940
You look awesome, Finral!

37
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:06,060
Yeah, you think you could do mine next?

38
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:08,260
Why would I style a loser's hair?

39
00:03:08,540 --> 00:03:11,040
You look fine to me, like the failure that you are.

40
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:13,620
Oh, yeah? Come over here and say that!

41
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:17,740
Hey, take it easy, Magnet. Just try to stay calm, like a loser should.

42
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:21,320
Hey! You mess with me right now, and I'm gonna kill you!

43
00:03:22,380 --> 00:03:24,320
Sounds like someone's looking to spar!

44
00:03:24,780 --> 00:03:26,900
Whoa, whoa! It's not the time!

45
00:03:26,900 --> 00:03:33,560
In spite of his rough looks, that guy seems like he knows his way around flame magic.

46
00:03:33,900 --> 00:03:35,600
The lightning mage is skilled as well.

47
00:03:39,540 --> 00:03:42,620
Hey there! You got any more food, mister?

48
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:46,260
My goodness, for something your size, you certainly can't eat!

49
00:03:46,260 --> 00:03:50,080
Marie, Angel, how I miss you, my darling.

50
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:51,920
What's going on?

51
00:03:52,300 --> 00:03:53,840
It's just the black bulls.

52
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:56,480
Still the same idiots they've always been.

53
00:03:56,900 --> 00:04:00,080
Stop! This is embarrassing! You're making all of us look bad!

54
00:04:07,140 --> 00:04:08,860
You're looking a little stiff there.

55
00:04:09,820 --> 00:04:10,580
Worried, huh?

56
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:13,240
About the match? And who you're facing?

57
00:04:14,060 --> 00:04:15,680
Well, yeah, a little.

58
00:04:16,340 --> 00:04:20,380
I mean, he might be my younger brother, but I've never beaten him at anything.

59
00:04:20,380 --> 00:04:33,220
Don't worry. I've fought alongside you, so I know. You changed after meeting Asta, just like I did. Thanks to him, I was finally able to face something I'd hidden deep inside my heart.

60
00:04:33,220 --> 00:04:41,240
You're not going to lose to him so easily anymore. Go show him how awesome you are. And I don't just mean the hair.

61
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:43,340
Thanks, Vanessa.

62
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:45,820
She's right! You totally got this!

63
00:04:45,900 --> 00:04:48,460
I want to fight you, so don't be a big loser like Magna!

64
00:04:48,460 --> 00:04:50,420
Yeah, don't be a big loser like Magna!

65
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:52,060
That's it! I'm going to kill you!

66
00:04:53,700 --> 00:04:55,540
We'll all be rooting for you, Cinderella!

67
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:57,860
You can do it. You can do it. You can do it.

68
00:04:57,860 --> 00:05:01,980
You'd better not blow this match and embarrass the rest of the squad.

69
00:05:03,260 --> 00:05:10,800
Wow. You guys, thank you all. I don't know what to say. I'm so happy I joined the Black Bulls. You're like a family.

70
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:13,540
Feed me, feed me, feed me, feed me, feed me, feed me, feed me, feed me!

71
00:05:14,320 --> 00:05:17,600
Hurry up and win this. I need to return to Marie as soon as possible.

72
00:05:18,300 --> 00:05:19,620
I'm your superior!

73
00:05:20,340 --> 00:05:23,360
And I'm sure Captain Yami's cheering you on back at the hideout, too.

74
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:28,720
That's right. His stomach wasn't feeling well, or else I'd know he would have been here to show his support.

75
00:05:29,260 --> 00:05:33,300
Even so, I'm sure he wants you to work hard. With or without him.

76
00:05:35,380 --> 00:05:39,460
Huh. Those morons are probably pushing past their limits right now.

77
00:05:39,980 --> 00:05:43,900
Just like I'm about to. This is the biggest dump the world's ever seen.

78
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:47,400
Dammit, kid! I told you to restock the toilet paper!

79
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:54,160
Give up now. You must know you stand no chance of defeating me.

80
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:59,780
No, you're wrong. Thanks to my friends, I'm stronger than I used to be. Our team will win.

81
00:06:00,460 --> 00:06:03,800
We'll see about that, brother. Don't blame me if you get hurt.

82
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:07,640
If it's okay with you, I'd like to handle him myself.

83
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,400
Hmm. Seems fine.

84
00:06:09,500 --> 00:06:14,520
A battle between brothers. I hope to test my fighting prowess against my own brother someday.

85
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:18,080
So, yes, I agree to your request and wish you the best of luck.

86
00:06:18,300 --> 00:06:21,540
Ha ha! I'll ride this Seke shooting star to victory.

87
00:06:21,980 --> 00:06:23,660
All shall remember my performance.

88
00:06:24,180 --> 00:06:26,860
Your team won't lay a finger on our crystal in this match.

89
00:06:27,200 --> 00:06:29,280
Ah! It's finally starting!

90
00:06:29,740 --> 00:06:31,760
I can't help but feel nervous for him.

91
00:06:32,440 --> 00:06:34,940
You can win this, Finral. I know you can.

92
00:06:34,940 --> 00:06:42,620
And now, Team E, comprised of Leopold, Hammond, and Finral, versus Langris, Fragile, and Seke of Team G.

93
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,920
Round two, match two, begin!

94
00:06:45,300 --> 00:06:47,340
You guys concentrate on destroying their crystal.

95
00:06:47,820 --> 00:06:48,800
We've got this.

96
00:06:48,960 --> 00:06:50,940
First, we need to determine its location.

97
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:53,940
Now, glass magic fair detection!

98
00:06:53,940 --> 00:07:04,140
The light will reflect off the glass shards scattered throughout the battleground, and every last inch of it will be revealed to me.

99
00:07:04,820 --> 00:07:10,200
This may take some time, but rest assured, I've no doubt I will find the enemy's crystal.

100
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:11,300
Oh.

101
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:14,940
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!

102
00:07:14,940 --> 00:07:20,140
I expect you to take me all the way to the enemy base again, Mr. Ha ha ha.

103
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:22,780
Leave it to me! And the name's actually Seke?

104
00:07:23,100 --> 00:07:24,540
Please feel free to use it.

105
00:07:24,940 --> 00:07:27,160
You can even call me Sec for short. Ha ha!

106
00:07:27,420 --> 00:07:29,120
Whatever you say, Mr. Ha ha.

107
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:31,660
Ha ha! No, I just told you!

108
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,420
It's Seke! Seke!

109
00:07:33,420 --> 00:07:33,540
Seke!

110
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:37,000
You brought shame upon the House of Fod.

111
00:07:37,460 --> 00:07:39,700
There's no way I'll let you defeat me today.

112
00:07:41,420 --> 00:07:43,580
How could I possibly love you?

113
00:07:43,580 --> 00:07:46,140
You aren't even my own flesh and blood.

114
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:50,040
My sweet little Longris is the only child I need.

115
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:55,380
Come now, Mother, don't you think it's a bit cruel to put it so bluntly?

116
00:07:56,020 --> 00:07:58,060
What can you accomplish with that?

117
00:07:58,760 --> 00:08:00,440
Learn to attack like Longris!

118
00:08:02,520 --> 00:08:03,980
What do you know?

119
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:08,360
My Longris is both more athletic and more intelligent than you.

120
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:10,060
Ha ha ha ha!

121
00:08:10,060 --> 00:08:13,000
You're so amazing, darling Longris.

122
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:15,960
Yes, as I should expect from my own flesh and blood.

123
00:08:15,960 --> 00:08:20,460
Unlike you, Findle, you're a disgrace to the Fod name.

124
00:08:22,460 --> 00:08:23,460
How pathetic.

125
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:27,440
He's the older brother, but there's not a single thing he can do better than me.

126
00:08:27,440 --> 00:08:30,220
What? A fiancé?

127
00:08:30,900 --> 00:08:35,940
Yes. This is Lady Finnis. She will marry the next head of the House of Vord.

128
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:38,400
Nice to meet you.

129
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:49,100
Her chronic illness keeps her housebound mostly, but the king is her great-uncle, so she comes from a prestigious family, and her magic is impressive.

130
00:08:49,100 --> 00:08:56,560
Ugh. This is the woman I'm going to marry? Couldn't father have chosen someone less... dull?

131
00:08:56,560 --> 00:09:03,020
Now remember, dear, Lady Finnis is going to be your bride someday, so you must try to get along with her.

132
00:09:03,020 --> 00:09:04,020
Of course!

133
00:09:04,020 --> 00:09:16,020
Honestly, I don't need a wife with a fancy title. When I'm the lord of this house, I'll bring more honor to the Vod family than anyone has before.

134
00:09:16,020 --> 00:09:18,160
Ugh. I'm so bored.

135
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:27,140
I'm very sorry. I doubt many men would choose to marry a woman who's both sickly and older than they are.

136
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:32,600
I... I mean, any man would be lucky to have a wife as beautiful as you, Lady Finnis.

137
00:09:34,020 --> 00:09:38,180
It's just that I'm not actually the one who will become the next head of House of Vod.

138
00:09:39,280 --> 00:09:43,880
I'm sure my younger brother will make you happy, though. He's better at everything than I am.

139
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:50,000
His magic's amazing, and he's really brave. Compared to him, I'm a total failure.

140
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:55,980
Exactly. At least he realizes he's inferior to me and...

141
00:09:55,980 --> 00:10:03,580
No, you're wrong. I know I've only met you a few times, but I can tell. You're a very kind, considerate person.

142
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:07,860
So if you ask me, you're a better mage than your brother will ever be.

143
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:13,420
Oh! You're joking, of course! Please don't tease me like that!

144
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:16,120
Don't be silly. I wasn't teasing you at all.

145
00:10:17,620 --> 00:10:21,580
Who does the sparrow think she is? Rating me lower than that failure.

146
00:10:23,180 --> 00:10:27,060
Utterly absurd. He left the family because he couldn't handle the pressure.

147
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:31,620
He's not better than me at anything. Not a single thing!

148
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:34,440
Ha-ha! We found it!

149
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:40,980
Well, I hope you're ready, Finral, because here he comes.

150
00:10:42,340 --> 00:10:46,160
Remember what I said. Don't blame me if you wind up losing a limb or two.

151
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:48,180
I'll end this in a single blow!

152
00:10:48,180 --> 00:10:53,180
What?

153
00:10:53,640 --> 00:10:56,800
That's right. I tested this earlier with Cobb.

154
00:10:57,040 --> 00:10:59,600
Something happens when spatial magic spells clash.

155
00:11:00,340 --> 00:11:04,420
The monocurrents within them collide, causing them to cancel each other out.

156
00:11:04,660 --> 00:11:05,660
Just like that!

157
00:11:06,020 --> 00:11:08,580
Longris, you won't win this time!

158
00:11:08,580 --> 00:11:20,220
That's so cool!

159
00:11:21,220 --> 00:11:23,960
So two spatial magic spells cancel each other out?

160
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:25,780
He didn't see that coming.

161
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:29,540
It's like Finral's a totally different person out there!

162
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:31,960
Lose at this point and I'll kill ya!

163
00:11:32,580 --> 00:11:34,740
Hurry up and finish it. Marie's waiting.

164
00:11:34,740 --> 00:11:38,540
I can almost taste the Victory Cupcakes now!

165
00:11:40,060 --> 00:11:40,960
Uh, huh?

166
00:11:42,400 --> 00:11:43,560
Ha-ha-ha!

167
00:11:43,860 --> 00:11:46,820
It looks like we made a good choice letting you take him on.

168
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:48,960
Hammond! Any luck yet?

169
00:11:49,500 --> 00:11:52,480
Yes! I finally found the enemy's crystal!

170
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,440
It's hidden within that tower!

171
00:11:55,080 --> 00:11:56,520
Right! Now go!

172
00:11:56,820 --> 00:11:57,300
Quickly!

173
00:11:59,940 --> 00:12:00,940
They're gone!

174
00:12:00,940 --> 00:12:05,040
You've gotten too cocky, but I'll put you back in your place!

175
00:12:11,180 --> 00:12:14,080
Step aside! We're gonna destroy that crystal!

176
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:16,880
We'll see about that.

177
00:12:19,980 --> 00:12:21,120
What's this?

178
00:12:21,620 --> 00:12:24,240
Snow magic. Phantom Snow Garden.

179
00:12:24,860 --> 00:12:26,080
Do you feel it yet?

180
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:29,080
This spell both deadens your senses and induces sleep.

181
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:32,620
While it's active, you won't be able to attack me effectively.

182
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,040
Uh...

183
00:12:34,040 --> 00:12:37,260
Yeah, right!

184
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:40,100
I'm not tired at all!

185
00:12:40,620 --> 00:12:43,780
This is nothing compared to my older sister's training!

186
00:12:44,260 --> 00:12:44,820
Nothing!

187
00:12:45,580 --> 00:12:48,160
Did you honestly think that this would be enough?

188
00:12:48,500 --> 00:12:49,020
Exactly!

189
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:50,780
We can take her, no problem!

190
00:12:50,780 --> 00:12:53,120
I could eat five more helpings.

191
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,640
Still have room left.

192
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:56,480
You're talking in your sleep?

193
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:59,820
Why fight it? You look like you can use the rest.

194
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:04,600
Those flames!

195
00:13:05,060 --> 00:13:08,540
I bear the house vermilion symbol of an oath made to oneself!

196
00:13:09,040 --> 00:13:12,040
I swore a vow that one day I would surpass my brother!

197
00:13:12,660 --> 00:13:15,520
So I'm not about to lose to somebody like you!

198
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:17,100
There's no way!

199
00:13:18,020 --> 00:13:18,620
Monastin!

200
00:13:18,620 --> 00:13:21,420
Go, flame magic!

201
00:13:22,500 --> 00:13:23,740
Spiral flame!

202
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:28,900
His senses are still sharp.

203
00:13:29,220 --> 00:13:32,300
He managed to nullify my spell by enveloping himself in mana.

204
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:34,340
Stay strong!

205
00:13:34,760 --> 00:13:36,160
Can't lose my concentration!

206
00:13:37,500 --> 00:13:39,180
I won't last much longer.

207
00:13:39,760 --> 00:13:40,540
Hurry, Longris.

208
00:13:40,540 --> 00:13:42,540
Ah!

209
00:13:48,620 --> 00:13:52,360
A battle between two adept spatial magic users!

210
00:13:52,580 --> 00:13:54,460
You don't see one of those every day!

211
00:13:55,140 --> 00:13:55,580
Oh!

212
00:13:56,140 --> 00:13:58,740
So that's the vaude boy Venus is going to marry.

213
00:13:59,220 --> 00:13:59,980
He's talented.

214
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:02,400
Still no match for me, though.

215
00:14:02,740 --> 00:14:03,700
Keep it up, Fenril!

216
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,040
You've got him now!

217
00:14:05,040 --> 00:14:08,700
You just have to hold out until the other two destroy the enemy's crystal!

218
00:14:09,080 --> 00:14:09,720
Who knew?

219
00:14:10,260 --> 00:14:12,920
I never imagined you had what it took to stand against me.

220
00:14:13,680 --> 00:14:17,140
Do you plan on playing defense all by yourself until your crystal breaks?

221
00:14:17,500 --> 00:14:19,100
I'm not going to make it easy!

222
00:14:19,100 --> 00:14:20,760
I'm sure you won't.

223
00:14:21,040 --> 00:14:22,020
That's fine.

224
00:14:23,860 --> 00:14:26,140
Because I came prepared to fight!

225
00:14:29,180 --> 00:14:29,940
Ha ha!

226
00:14:30,280 --> 00:14:35,800
You're an even bigger idiot than I realized if you think a sluggish spell like that could ever catch my marvelous self!

227
00:14:39,400 --> 00:14:39,880
Incoming?

228
00:14:39,880 --> 00:14:46,320
That's an interesting feature, but it's still no match for my invincible Seke Magnum Cannonball!

229
00:14:46,660 --> 00:14:47,420
Ha ha ha!

230
00:14:49,160 --> 00:14:49,680
What?

231
00:14:50,140 --> 00:14:51,320
He just disappeared?

232
00:14:53,360 --> 00:14:55,040
Even I think it's pitiful.

233
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:57,400
I trained like crazy, but it didn't matter.

234
00:14:57,760 --> 00:15:00,020
I never managed to learn a single attack spell.

235
00:15:00,880 --> 00:15:01,280
Wait.

236
00:15:01,700 --> 00:15:03,240
It's not an attack spell?

237
00:15:04,480 --> 00:15:05,800
That's spatial magic.

238
00:15:06,120 --> 00:15:07,260
Fallen Angel's wingbeat.

239
00:15:07,260 --> 00:15:12,220
It follows the enemy, makes contact, then transports them to another location.

240
00:15:12,780 --> 00:15:15,700
It's a battlefield application of the spell I usually use.

241
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:21,820
He adapted a basic spatial magic spell so he can get rid of his enemies without harming them!

242
00:15:22,160 --> 00:15:25,160
Clearly, this is a mage who possesses a truly gentle soul!

243
00:15:25,380 --> 00:15:27,720
